# Ruling 2025-07-25: "Any 'enters with' abilities of the copied permanent will also work." Callous Sell-Sword enters with a +1/+1
# counter for each creature that died under its controller's control this turn. Bot1 casts Devastating Onslaught (X=1) on its
# Sell-Sword; in response Bot2 Lightning Bolts Bot1's Ornithopter, which dies. The token Sell-Sword then enters with ONE counter
# (a 3/3), counted as it enters (the Sell-Sword original has none: it entered before the Ornithopter died). The token is
# sacrificed at the end step.

